WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.500
Your agent just denied a claim.

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:03.500
Now prove why.

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:04.300
Meet

00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:06.300
EPI Labs

00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:09.500
Decision records for AI agents.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:15.300
It records the prompt, the tool call, the policy check, and the decision it made.

00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:19.300
Hash-chained, redacted, signed into one file.

00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:20.900
Verify it offline.

00:00:20.900 --> 00:00:22.100
No account.

00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:23.100
No server.

00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:26.300
Change one byte, and the seal fails closed.

00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:28.900
Your customer checks it without logging in.

00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:32.500
One command: record, seal, and verify.

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:34.100
Start with one decision.
